{#
  Changelog template owned by this repository.

  `cz`'s stock template emits only the release sections, so a full
  `cz changelog` regeneration silently deletes the header below and only
  `cz bump --changelog` puts sections back. Keeping the header in the template
  makes a full regeneration reproducible instead of something to repair by hand.

  Selected by `template = "CHANGELOG.j2"` in .cz.toml; `cz` resolves it from the
  repository root.
#}
# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented here.
The format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/).
Entries are generated from the commit history by [Commitizen](https://commitizen-tools.github.io/commitizen/); do not edit them by hand.
{% for entry in tree %}

## {{ entry.version }}{% if entry.date %} ({{ entry.date }}){% endif %}

{% for change_key, changes in entry.changes.items() %}

{% if change_key %}
### {{ change_key }}
{% endif %}

{% for change in changes %}
{% if change.scope %}
- **{{ change.scope }}**: {{ change.message }}
{% elif change.message %}
- {{ change.message }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
